<doc id="145231" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145231" title="Brent Berlin">
Brent Berlin

Brent Berlin ya iku ahli antropologi saka &lt;a href="Texas"&gt;Texas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalahiran taun 1936. Berlin njupuk kuliah sarjana (BA) ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Oklahoma"&gt;Universitas Oklahoma&lt;/a&gt; taun 1959. Sabanjuré kuliah pasca sarjana (MA) ing Universitas Standford taun 1960. Dhèwèké uga olèh gelar doktor (Ph.D) ing pawiyatan luhur kang padha taun 1964. Berlin naté nglakoni panilitian lapangan (field work) antarané ing Chiapas &lt;a href="M%C3%A8ksiko"&gt;Mèksiko&lt;/a&gt; (1960-1966), Aguaruna Jivaro, &lt;a href="Peru"&gt;Peru&lt;/a&gt; (1970), lan Tzeltal, Tzotzil Maya, Meksiko (1980). Berlin uga naté nliti bareng karo Paul Kay. Berlin akéh nulis karya-karya tulisan ilmiah, ing antarané kang wis diterbitké ya iku Tzeltal Numeral Classifiers: A Study in Ethnographic Semantics (1968), Basic Color Terms: Their Universality and Evolution (1969), Principles of Tzeltal Plant Classification; An Introduction to the Botanical Ethnography of a Mayan-Speaking People of Highland Chiapas (1974), lan Ethnobiological Classification (1992). Ing ranah &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Berlin"&gt;Berlin&lt;/a&gt; iki duwé pandhangan ing bab ètnosemantik logika panlitiané kang kapisan. Uga &lt;a href="Berlin"&gt;Berlin&lt;/a&gt; nliti sistem klasifikasi nomor ing bebrayan Maya. Berlin duwé pisumbangan ing bab &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="biologi"&gt;biologi&lt;/a&gt; amarga dhèwèké wis nliti lan karenan ing kosatembung ètnobiologi tinimbang kajian téoritis lan èmpiris.
<h2>Rujukan</h2>

</doc>
<doc id="145241" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145241" title="H. Russel Bernard">
H. Russel Bernard

H.Russell Bernard ya iku ahli antropolog saka &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalahiran taun 1940. Bernard njupuk kuliah sarjana (BA) ing Quens College, lulus taun 1961. Sabanjuré pasca sarjana (MA) ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Illinois"&gt;Universitas Illinois&lt;/a&gt; (1963), lan doktor taun 1968 ing pawiyatan luhur kang padha. Dhèwèké naté nglakoni panilitian lapangan (field work) ing &lt;a href="At%C3%A9na"&gt;Athena&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt; (1969-1970), Pulo Naxos (1964), Kreta Yunani (1990), &lt;a href="M%C3%A8ksiko"&gt;Mèksiko&lt;/a&gt; (1969, 1974), Florida Amerika (1963), &lt;a href="Virginia"&gt;Virginia&lt;/a&gt; (1972), lan &lt;a href="San%20Diego"&gt;San Diego&lt;/a&gt; (1972). Bernard nulis karya-karya tulisan, antarané kang wis diterbitké ya iku ‘On the social structure of an ocean-going research vessel and other important things’, Social Research (1973), Research Methods in Cultural Anthropology (1988), Native Ethnography: A Mexican Indian Describes His Culture (1989), lan ‘Estimating the size of an average personal network and of an event population’, in M.Kochen (ed.) The Small World (1989). Bernard wis gawé pisumbangan kang utama ing &lt;a href="antropologi%20budaya"&gt;antropologi budaya&lt;/a&gt; luwih saka 40 taun. Dhéwéké wis nerbitké karya-karya tulisan ing bab antropologi linguistik, téknologi, owah-owahan sosial (social change), ètnografi wong asli (native ethnography), analisis jaringan sosial, lan metodé panlitian antropologi budaya.
<h2>Rujukan</h2>

</doc>
<doc id="145243" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145243" title="Catherine Helen Berndt">
Catherine Helen Berndt

Catherine Helen Berndt ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; wanita saka &lt;a href="Auckland"&gt;Auckland&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Niu%20S%C3%A9lan"&gt;Niu Sélan&lt;/a&gt; kalahiran 8 Mei 1918. Pendhidhikan sarjana Berndt iku diwiwiti kuliah sarjana (BA) ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20New%20Zealand"&gt;Universitas New Zealand&lt;/a&gt; (1939). Berndt olèh sertifikat kaahlian &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka universitas mau taun 1940. Sabanjuré Berndt kuliah diploma antropologi ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Sydney"&gt;Universitas Sydney&lt;/a&gt; taun 1943, pasca sarjana (MA) ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Sydney"&gt;Universitas Sydney&lt;/a&gt; taun 1949, lan doktor (Ph.D) ing London School of Economics (1955). Akéh panlitian antropologiné Berndt ing wewengkon bebrayan Aborigin Ostrali kayadéné Kainantu, Ooldea, Birrundudu, lan uga ing &lt;a href="Papua%20Nugini"&gt;Papua Nugini&lt;/a&gt; (1951-1953). Karya-karya tulisané Berndt kang wis diterbitké iku antarané A Preliminary Report on Fieldwork in the Ooldea Region, Western South Australia, (1945), Womens Changing Ceremonies in Northern Australia (1950), The World of the First Australians (1964), lan A World That Was: The Yaraldi of the Murray River and The Lakes, South Australia (1993). Bendt duwé akéh pisumbangan kang akéh ing kawruh bebrayan &lt;a href="Aborigin"&gt;Aborigin&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Ostrali"&gt;Ostrali&lt;/a&gt; minangka kariré sajroning enem dékade. Berndt olèh pangaji the Percy Smith Medal saka &lt;a href="University%20of%20Otago"&gt;University of Otago&lt;/a&gt; amarga karir akademik lan piwulangé. Berndt séda ing 12 Mei 1994 ing papan &lt;a href="Ostrali"&gt;Ostrali&lt;/a&gt; Kulon.
<h2>Rujukan</h2>

</doc>
<doc id="145244" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145244" title="Ronald Murray Berndt">
Ronald Murray Berndt

Ronald Murray Berndt ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Adelaide"&gt;Adelaide&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ostrali"&gt;Ostrali&lt;/a&gt;. Berndt lair ing 14 Juli 1916. Murray Bendt njupuk diploma antropologi saka Universitas Sydney (1943). Sabanjuré, dhèwèké kuliah sarjana antropologi (BA) lan pasca sarjana (MA) ing pawiyatan luhur kang padha (1950-1951). Berndt uga njupuk kuliah doktor ing London School of Economics, (1955). Berndt nglakoni panlitian lapangan ing akéh papan ing Ostrali kayadéné Ooldea, Murray Bridge, Birrundudu, Arnhem Land, lan Balgo Hills kang diwiwiti taun 1939. Berndt uga naté panlitian ing &lt;a href="Papua%20Nugini"&gt;Papua Nugini&lt;/a&gt; (1951). Karya-karya tulisané Berndt kang wis diterbitké antarané A Preliminary Report on Fieldwork in the Ooldea Region, Western South Australia (1945), Kunapipi: A Study of an Australian Aboriginal Religious Cult (1951), The World of the First Australians (1964), lan A World That Was: The Yaraldi of the Murray River and The Lakes, South Australia (1993). Murray Berndt iki ya iku jaler sing &lt;a href="Catherine%20Helen%20Berndt"&gt;Catherine Helen Berndt&lt;/a&gt;. Amarga iku karenan lan kariré rada padha karo istriné iku. Berndt nyumbang akéh panemuné ing kawruh ètnografi bebrayan Aborigin Ostrali. Berndt menggawé cara kolaborasi karo istriné, Catherine. Berndt iki wis karenan karo ngèlmu &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; nalika dhèwèké isih cilik.
<h2>Rujukan</h2>

</doc>
<doc id="145245" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145245" title="Gerald Berreman">
Gerald Berreman

Gerald R. Berreman ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="oregon"&gt;oregon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalahiran taun 1930. Berreman oléh pandhidhikan sarjana ing Universitas Oregon (1952), pasca sarjana (MA) taun 1953. Sabanjuré dhèwèké kuliah doktor (Ph.D) ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Cornell"&gt;Universitas Cornell&lt;/a&gt; taun 1959. Berreman naté nglakoni panlitian lapangan antropologi ana ing Kapuloan Aleutian (1952, 1962), India (1957, 1981), Nepal (1994, 1997), lan Fiji (Juli-Agustus 1991). Karya-karya tulisané Berreman kang wis diterbitké iku antarané ‘Seeking social justice: ethnic politics in India, the United States and Japan’, in Plenary Lectures: Second International Human Rights Seminar (1999), Hindus of the Himalayas: Ethnography and Change (1997), ‘The Incredible Tasaday’, Cultural Survival Quarterly (1991), ‘Ethics versus realism in anthropology’, ing C.Fluehr-Lobban (ed.) Ethics and the Profession of Anthropology (1991). Berreman kawentar ing fokusé bab tetandingan ke-ora adil-an sosial (comparative social inequality) kang kalebu ing hak-hak asasi manungsa, prakara-prakara lingkungan, ètik &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt;, lan metode &lt;a href="%C3%A8tnografi"&gt;ètnografi&lt;/a&gt;. Berreman nganggo teori interaksi sosial minangka hasil gabungan pandhangan simbolis &lt;a href="interaksionisme"&gt;interaksionisme&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%C3%A8tnometodologi"&gt;ètnometodologi&lt;/a&gt;, lan tèori praktis.
<h2>Rujukan</h2>

</doc>
<doc id="145246" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145246" title="André Beteille">
André Beteille

André Beteille ya iku salah siji ahli &lt;a href="Antropologi"&gt;Antropologi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sosiologi"&gt;Sosiologi&lt;/a&gt; kalahiran ing &lt;a href="Kalkuta"&gt;Kalkuta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indhi"&gt;Indhi&lt;/a&gt; taun 1935. Beteille olèh pendhidhikan antropologi saka Presidency College, Calcutta (sarjana BA) lan doktor (Ph.D) ing Delhi School of Economics. Panlitian lapangan antropologi kang wis dilakoni ya iku ing Kerala, Tamil Nadu, &lt;a href="Indhi"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt; kidul. Dhéwéké wis akéh nulis werna-werna karya tulis, antarané kang wis diterbité iku Caste, Class and Power; Changing Patterns in a Tanjore village (1965), The Idea of Natural Inequality and Other Essays (1983), Society and Politics in India, Essays in Comparative Perspective (1991), lan Antinomies of Society: Essays on Ideologies and Institutions (2000). Amarga Beteille tansah nglakoni panlitian ing wewengkon India, dhèwèké dadi fokus ing bab bebrayan &lt;a href="Indhi"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;, khususé ing pulitik, stratifikasi sosial, lan hak-hak sipil. Beteille dadi sawiji antropolog kang nganut tradisi antropologi ortodoks &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt; kang tokohé iku Radcliffe-Brown.
<h2>Rujukan</h2>

</doc>
<doc id="145247" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145247" title="Gilles Bibeau">
Gilles Bibeau

Gilles Bibeau ya iku sawiji ahli &lt;a href="Antropologi"&gt;Antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka Tracy, &lt;a href="Quebec"&gt;Quebec&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kanadha"&gt;Kanadha&lt;/a&gt; kalahiran taun 1940. Bibeau naté kuliah sarjana ngèlmu sosial ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Montreal"&gt;Universitas Montreal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kanadha"&gt;Kanadha&lt;/a&gt;, taun 1961. Sabanjuré kuliah doktor ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Laval"&gt;Universitas Laval&lt;/a&gt; taun 1979. Bibeau naté nglakoni panlitian lapangan &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; ing Ubangi lan Kinshasa, &lt;a href="Zaire"&gt;Zaire&lt;/a&gt; (1966-1978), Montreal Quebec Kanada (1985), Chennai &lt;a href="Indhi"&gt;Indhi&lt;/a&gt; (1997), lan Salvador &lt;a href="Brasil"&gt;Brasil&lt;/a&gt; (1997). Dhéwéké nulis karya-karya antropologis kayadéné Beyond Textuality: Asceticism and Violence in Anthropological Interpretation (1995) lan ‘Cultural psychiatry in a creolizing world’, Transcultural Psychiatry (1997). Ing tlatah &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kanadha"&gt;Kanadha&lt;/a&gt;, Bibeau iki dadi sawijiné antropolog kang mimpin ngrembakané ngèlmu spésialis &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kedhokteran"&gt;kedhokteran&lt;/a&gt;. Salah siji karenan panlitiané ya iku njarwakaké enggoné nambani cara tradhisional ing Zaire, séksualitas lan &lt;a href="AIDS"&gt;AIDS&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Afrika"&gt;Afrika&lt;/a&gt;, lan masalah kaséhatan ing pedesaan. Bibeau uga ngilhami cara métodologi étnografi ing wolung negara, kalebu &lt;a href="Brasil"&gt;Brazil&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mali"&gt;Mali&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indhi"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Itali"&gt;Itali&lt;/a&gt;.
