<doc id="145248" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145248" title="Yoram Bilu">
Yoram Bilu

Yoram Bilu ya iku salah siji ahli antropologi saka &lt;a href="Tel%20Aviv"&gt;Tel Aviv&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt; kalahiran taun 1942. Bilu olèh pendhidhikan sarjana (BA) (1968), pasca sarjana (MA) (1971), lan doktor (Ph.D.) (1979) ana ing pawiyatan luhur kang padha ya iku &lt;a href="The%20Hebrew%20University%20of%20Jerusalem"&gt;The Hebrew University of Jerusalem&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Y%C3%A9rusalem"&gt;Yérusalem&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt;. Bilu nglakoni panlitian antroologiné ing wewengkon &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israel&lt;/a&gt; kaya déné &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Maroko"&gt;Maroko&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Y%C3%A9rusalem"&gt;Yérusalem&lt;/a&gt; (1974) lan &lt;a href="Y%C3%A9rusalem"&gt;Yérusalem&lt;/a&gt; lor (1990). Karya-karya tulisané Bilu kang wis diterbitké iku antarané ‘The taming of the deviants and beyond: an analysis of Dybbuk possession and exorcism in Judaism’, The Psychoanalytic Study of Society (1985) lan Without Bounds: The Life and Death of Rabbi Ya’aqov Wazana (2000). Bilu ngutamaké fokus panlitiané ing prakara psiko-kultural agama, kaya ta sekola ultra-ortodoks lan &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; Maroko. Bilu duwé pisumbangan kang penting ing &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt;, mligi bab manifestasi praktik imigran Yahudi Maroko ing &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt; lan prakara liyané kang ana hubungané karo &lt;a href="yahudi"&gt;yahudi&lt;/a&gt;.
