<doc id="145273" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145273" title="John Anthony Randall Blacking">
John Anthony Randall Blacking

John Anthony Randall Blacking ya iku ahli &lt;a href="Antropologi"&gt;Antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka Surrey, &lt;a href="Karajan%20Manunggal"&gt;Karajan Manunggal&lt;/a&gt;, kalahiran taun 1928. Blacking olèh pandhidhikan antropologi saka &lt;a href="Universitas%20Cambridge"&gt;Universitas Cambridge&lt;/a&gt; (BA) taun 1953. Sabanjuré, dhèwèké njupuk kuliah doktor (Ph.D) ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Witwatersrand"&gt;Universitas Witwatersrand&lt;/a&gt; taun 1965. Blacking naté nglakoni panlitian lapangan antropologi ing &lt;a href="Rhodesia"&gt;Rhodesia&lt;/a&gt; awit raun 1956-1958. Karya-karya tulisan Blacking kang wis diterbitké iku kayadéné Venda Children’s Song. A Study in Ethnomusicological Analysis (1967), How Musical Is Man? (1967), "A Common-Sense View of All Music: Reflections on Percy Grainger’s Writings on
Ethnomusicology and Music Education(1987), lan Music, Culture and Experience: Selected Papers of John Blacking (1995). Ing kancah mancanegara, John Blacking kawentar amarga panlitiané ing bab ètnomusikologi. Dhéwéké dibimbing déning Meyer Fortes, lan sabanjuré déning ètnomusikolog André Schaeffner. Blacking kawentar kritis ing ngrembakané sub-ngèlmu &lt;a href="%C3%A8tnomusikologi"&gt;ètnomusikologi&lt;/a&gt;.
