<doc id="145274" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145274" title="Maurice E.F. Bloch">
Maurice E.F. Bloch

Maurice E.F. Bloch ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka Caen, &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt; kalahiran 21 Oktober 1939. Awité, Bloch njupuk pendhidhikan sarjana (BA) ing &lt;a href="London%20School%20of%20Economics"&gt;London School of Economics&lt;/a&gt; (1961). Sabanjuré ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Cambridge"&gt;Universitas Cambridge&lt;/a&gt; lan oléh gelar Ph.D (1967). Bloch naté nglakoni panlitian lapangan ing &lt;a href="Madagaskar"&gt;Madagaskar&lt;/a&gt; ing taun 1964, 1971, lan 1988. Bloch wis nulis karya-karya antropologis kayadéné Placing the Dead. Tombs, Ancestral Villages, and Kinship Organization in Madagascar (1971), (1986) From Blessing to Violence: History and Ideology in the Circumcision Ritual of the Merina of Madagascar, (1992) Prey into Hunter: The Politics of Religious Experience, lan (1998) How We Think They Think: Anthropological Approaches to Cognition, Memory and Literacy. Bloch duwé pisumbangan ya iku manggih analisa &lt;a href="psikologi"&gt;psikologi&lt;/a&gt; kanggo bab kritik &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt;. Amarga iku dhèwèké karenan lan ahli ing &lt;a href="kognitif"&gt;kognitif&lt;/a&gt; manungsa.
<h2>Rujukan</h2>

