<doc id="145277" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145277" title="Janice Boddy">
Janice Boddy

Janice Boddy iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; wanita saka &lt;a href="Toronto"&gt;Toronto&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kanada"&gt;Kanadha&lt;/a&gt;, kalahiran taun 1951. Boddy olèh pendhidhikan sarjana BA saka &lt;a href="Universitas%20McGrill"&gt;Universitas McGrill&lt;/a&gt; (1972), pasca sarjana (MA) ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Calgary"&gt;Universitas Calgary&lt;/a&gt; (1974), lan doktor Ph.D. ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20British%20Columbia"&gt;Universitas British Columbia&lt;/a&gt; (1982). Boddy naté nglakoni panlitian lapangan antropologis kanggo kajian élmuné ing &lt;a href="Sudan"&gt;Sudan&lt;/a&gt; (1976-1977), &lt;a href="Karajan%20Manunggal"&gt;Karajan Manunggal&lt;/a&gt; (1990, 1994, lan 1983), lan &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20L%C3%A8r"&gt;Amérika Lèr&lt;/a&gt; (1992,1993). Boddy wis nulis karya-karya tulis antropologis kang wis diterbitké antarané Wombs and Alien Spirits: Women, Men and the Zar Cult in Northern Sudan (1989) lan Aman: The Story of a Somali Girl (1994). Boddy kawentar amarga panemuné ing ètnigrafi interpretatif ing bebrayan &lt;a href="Sudan"&gt;Sudan&lt;/a&gt; lor. Dhéwéké uga nliti pangalaman wadon muslim ing &lt;a href="Somalia"&gt;Somali&lt;/a&gt; nganggo cara sujarah urip (life story). Bukuné bab wong wadon &lt;a href="Somalia"&gt;Somali&lt;/a&gt; ing wis dipertal ing 14 basa.
