<doc id="145344" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145344" title="Jeremy Fergus Boissevain">
Jeremy Fergus Boissevain

Jeremy Fergus Boissevain ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt;, kalahiran taun 1928. Pendhidhikan sarjanané (BA) olèh saka &lt;a href="Haverford%20Colleg"&gt;Haverford Colleg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pennsylvania"&gt;Pennsylvania&lt;/a&gt;, Amérikah Sarékat taun 1952. Sabanjuré, doktor (Ph.D.) &lt;a href="London%20Scholl%20of%20Economics"&gt;London Scholl of Economics&lt;/a&gt; taun 1952. Panlitian lapangan antropologis Fergus naté ing Fezzan &lt;a href="Libya"&gt;Libya&lt;/a&gt; (1959), &lt;a href="Malta"&gt;Malta&lt;/a&gt; (1960, 1973, 1993), &lt;a href="Sisilia"&gt;Sisilia&lt;/a&gt; (1962), &lt;a href="Montreal"&gt;Montreal&lt;/a&gt; (1962), lan &lt;a href="Amsterdam"&gt;Amsterdam&lt;/a&gt; (1983). Jeremy Bossevain wis nulis karya-karya antropologis kayadéné Saints and Fireworks: Religion and Politics in Rural Malta (1965), Friends of Friends. Networks, Manipulators and Coalitions (1974), lan Revitalizing European Rituals (1992). Dhèwèké dadi ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sosial"&gt;sosial&lt;/a&gt; budaya amarga mèlu program CARE Aid ing &lt;a href="Pilipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indhi"&gt;Indi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Malta"&gt;Malta&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Sisilia"&gt;Sisilia&lt;/a&gt;. Jeremy Boissevain karenan ing bab tingkat lokal &lt;a href="pulitik"&gt;pulitik&lt;/a&gt;. Liyané, dhèwèké uga akèh pisumbangané ing &lt;a href="%C3%A8tnografi"&gt;ètnografi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Segara%20Tengah"&gt;Mediterania&lt;/a&gt;, khususé ing &lt;a href="Malta"&gt;Malta&lt;/a&gt;. Karyané saka wewengkon iku Hal-Farrug. A Village in Malta (1969) dadi salah siji karyané kang duwé pengaruh.
