James Boon ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Florida"&gt;Florida&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalahiran taun 1946. Boon olèh pendhidhikan ing bidang antropologi ing &lt;a href="Princeton%20University"&gt;Princeton University&lt;/a&gt; (BA) taun 1968 lan doktor (Ph.D) saka &lt;a href="Universitas%20Chicago"&gt;Universitas Chicago&lt;/a&gt; taun 1973. Boon naté nglakoni panlitian antropologis ing &lt;a href="Jawa"&gt;Jawa&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bali"&gt;Bali&lt;/a&gt; (1971, 1982, 1992), &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ostrali"&gt;Ostrali&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt;. Boon uga wis nulis karya-karya antropologis kayadéné From Symbolism to Structuralism: Lévi-Strauss in a Literary Tradition (1972), Other Tribes, Other Scribes: Symbolic Anthropology in the Comparative Study of Cultures, Histories, Religions, and Texts (1982), Affinities and Extremes: Crisscrossing the Bittersweet Ethnology of East Indies History, Hindu-Balinese Culture, and Indo-European Allure (1990). James Boon dadi sawiji antropolog kang wis nliti kajian &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;, kolonial Ero-Amérika, lan sujarah inteléktual. Clifford Geertz uga naté ndampingi Boon nalika panlitian doktoré ing &lt;a href="Bali"&gt;Bali&lt;/a&gt;. Boon uga duwé jasa ngembangké téori Lévi-Strauss.
