<doc id="145615" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145615" title="John Borneman">
John Borneman

John Borneman ya iku ahli &lt;a href="Antropologi"&gt;Antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Wisconsin"&gt;Wisconsin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan taun 1952. Pandhidhikan sarjanané (BA) iku saka &lt;a href="University%20Wisconsin-Madison"&gt;University Wisconsin-Madison&lt;/a&gt; taun 1973, pasca sarjana (MA) saka &lt;a href="Universitas%20Washington"&gt;Universitas Washington&lt;/a&gt; (1983) lan &lt;a href="Universitas%20Harvard"&gt;Universitas Harvard&lt;/a&gt; (1985), lan uga doktor (Ph.D) saka &lt;a href="Universitas%20Harvard"&gt;Universitas Harvard&lt;/a&gt; taun 1989. Borneman naté nglakoni panlitian lapangan antropologi ing &lt;a href="Berlin"&gt;Berlin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt; (1984-2000), &lt;a href="Praha"&gt;Praha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Warsawa"&gt;Warsawa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Budapest"&gt;Budapest&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Moscow%20City"&gt;Moscow City&lt;/a&gt; (1994), lan &lt;a href="Beirut"&gt;Beirut&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Libanon"&gt;Libanon&lt;/a&gt; (1999). Borneman wis nulis werna-werna karya tulis, antarané ya iku Belonging in the Two Berlins: Kin, State, Nation (1992) lan Settling Accounts: Violence, Justice, and Accountability in Postsocialist Europe (1997). Ing kalangan antropolog ing &lt;a href="Berlin"&gt;Berlin&lt;/a&gt;, Borneman kondhang minangka ètnografer, kanca panlitian (research fellow), lan profésor utawa guru gedhé &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt;. Pisumbangané iku panlitiané ing bab transformasi nagara &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;.
