<doc id="145677" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145677" title="Philippe Bourgois">
Philippe Bourgois

Philippe Bourgois ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan 8 Dhésémber 1956. Bourgois naté kuliah sarjana (BA) ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Harvard"&gt;Universitas Harvard&lt;/a&gt; taun 1978. Sabanjuré pasca sarjana (MA) ing &lt;a href="Universitas%20Stanford"&gt;Universitas Stanford&lt;/a&gt; taun 1980 lan doktor (Ph.D) ing pawiyatan luhur kang padha taun 1985. Dhéwéké naté nglakoni panlitian lapangan ing Costa Rica lan &lt;a href="Panama"&gt;Panama&lt;/a&gt; (1982-1983), &lt;a href="Harlem%20Wetan"&gt;Harlem Wetan&lt;/a&gt; (1985), lan &lt;a href="San%20Francisco"&gt;San Francisco&lt;/a&gt; (1994). Bourgois uga nulis karya-karya &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; kayadéné Ethnicity at Work: Divided Labor on a Central American Banana Plantation (1989) lan In Search of Respect: Selling Crack in El Barrio (1995). Bourgois akéh nliti bab kelas sosial, &lt;a href="%C3%A8tnografi"&gt;ètnografi&lt;/a&gt; sosial, lan hubungan makro-prabawa amarga ora adilé sosial. Bourgois uga karenan ing bab &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; kedhokteran. Dhéwéké uga ana pisumbangé ing proyék &lt;a href="%C3%A8tnografi"&gt;ètnografi&lt;/a&gt; antara &lt;a href="Pasar%C3%A9katan%20Bangsa-Bangsa"&gt;Pasarékatan Bangsa-Bangsa&lt;/a&gt; lan wong &lt;a href="Auschwitz"&gt;Auschwitz&lt;/a&gt;.
