<doc id="145678" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145678" title="Erika Bourguignon">
Erika Bourguignon

Erika Bourguignon ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; wanita saka &lt;a href="Wina"&gt;Wina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Osterich"&gt;Osterich&lt;/a&gt; kalairan 18 Fèbruari 1924. Erika naté kuliah sarjana (BA) ing &lt;a href="Queens%20College"&gt;Queens College&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="City%20University%20of%20New%20York"&gt;City University of New York&lt;/a&gt;, taun 1945. Sabanjuré kuliah doktor (Ph.D) ing &lt;a href="Northwestern%20University"&gt;Northwestern University&lt;/a&gt; taun 1951. Minangka lulusan &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt;, Erika naté nglakoni panlitian lapangan ing Reservasi Indian Lac de Flambeu, &lt;a href="Wisconsin"&gt;Wisconsin&lt;/a&gt; (1946), &lt;a href="Haiti"&gt;Haiti&lt;/a&gt; (1947), &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt; (1938), lan &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; (1939). Erika wis nulis karya-karya antropologis kayadéné Religion, Altered States of Consciousness, and Social Change (1973), Possession (1976), lan Psychological Anthropology (1979). Pisumbangan mligi Erika ing bidang antropologi ya iku ing &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="psikologi"&gt;psikologi&lt;/a&gt;, khususé bab kesurupan, posési jiwa (spirit possession), lan owahan sosial. Erika uga karenan ing rèlativisme budaya.
