<doc id="145680" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145680" title="Jonathan A. Boyarin">
Jonathan A. Boyarin

Jonathan A. Boyarin ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="New%20Jersey"&gt;New Jersey&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan 1956. Boyarin kuliah sarjana (BA) ing &lt;a href="Reed%20College"&gt;Reed College&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Oregon"&gt;Oregon&lt;/a&gt; (1977), pasca sarjana (MA) ing &lt;a href="New%20School%20for%20Social%20Research"&gt;New School for Social Research&lt;/a&gt;, taun 1980, lan dhoktor (Ph.D) ing &lt;a href="New%20School%20for%20Social%20Research"&gt;New School for Social Research&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;, taun 1984. Ing kampus Reed, Boyarin naté njupuk program basa, sastra, lan budhaya &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt;. Dhéwéké sinau ing School of Criticism and Theory ing &lt;a href="Dartmouth%20College"&gt;Dartmouth College&lt;/a&gt;, taun 1984. Amarga iku, prakara panlitian ora adoh karo bab &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt;, kayadéné ing &lt;a href="Y%C3%A9rusalem"&gt;Yérusalem&lt;/a&gt; (1991), bebrayan &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; ing kutha &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt; (1985), imigran &lt;a href="Sajarah%20kaum%20Yahudi%20ing%20Polandia"&gt;Yahudi Polandia&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Paris"&gt;Paris&lt;/a&gt; (1982). Boyarin wis nulis karya-karya antropologis, antarané kang wis diterbitké ya iku Storm from Paradise: The Politics of Jewish Memory (1992), Remapping Memory: The Politics of TimespaceI (1994), Palestine and Jewish History: Criticism at the Borders of Ethnography (1995), lan Thinking in Jewish (1996). Boyarin fokus ing bab sosial budaya bebrayan &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt;, amarga iku dhèwèké dhuwé pisumbangan akéh ing bab kuwi.
