<doc id="145987" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145987" title="Charles L. Briggs">
Charles L. Briggs

Charles L. Briggs ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Albuquerque"&gt;Albuquerque&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20Mexico"&gt;New Mexico&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan taun 1953. Briggs kuliah sarjana (BA) ing &lt;a href="Colorado%20College"&gt;Colorado College&lt;/a&gt; (1974), pasca sarjana (MA) ing &lt;a href="University%20of%20Chicago"&gt;University of Chicago&lt;/a&gt; taun 1978 lan dhoktor (Ph.D) taun 1982 ing pawiyatan luhur kang padha. Charles Briggs naté nglakoni panlitian antropologis ing Cordova, &lt;a href="New%20M%C3%A8ksiko"&gt;New Mèksiko&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Delta%20Amacuro"&gt;Delta Amacuro&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="V%C3%A9n%C3%A9zu%C3%A9la"&gt;Vénézuéla&lt;/a&gt; (1986). Dhéwéké uga wis nulis buku-buku antropologis kayadéné Learning How To Ask: A Sociolinguistic Appraisal of the Role of the Interview in Social Science Research (1986), Competence in Performance: The Creativity of Tradition in Mexicano Verbal Art (1988), lan Stories in the Time of Cholera: Racial Profiling during a Medical Nightmare (2003). Charles fokus ing bab hubungan antara tipe panganggo basa lan kategori sosial. Dhèwèké uga akèh pisumbangané ing bab mitos lan ritual ing Cordova, &lt;a href="M%C3%A8ksiko"&gt;Mèksiko&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Rujukan</h2>

</doc>
<doc id="145988" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=145988" title="Jean L. Briggs">
Jean L. Briggs

Jean L. Briggs ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; wanita saka &lt;a href="Washington"&gt;Washington&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; kalairan 29 Mei 1929. Briggs naté kuliah sarjana (BA) ing &lt;a href="Vassar%20College"&gt;Vassar College&lt;/a&gt; taun 1951. Sabanjuré pasca sarjana ing &lt;a href="Boston%20University"&gt;Boston University&lt;/a&gt; taun 1960 lan doktor (Ph.D) ing &lt;a href="Harvard%20University"&gt;Harvard University&lt;/a&gt; taun 1967. Jean Briggs iki naté nglakoni panlitian antropologis ing Alaska Inupiaq (1960), Inuit Kanada (1963-2002), Israel Bedouin (1985), lan Siberia Yuppik (1993). Jean wis nulis karya-karya antropologis ya iku Never in Anger: Portrait of on Eskimo Family (1970), ‘From trait to emblem and back: living and representing culture in everyday life’, ana ing jurnal Arctic Anthropology (1997), lan Inuit Morality Play: The Emotional Education of a Three Year Old (1998). Pakaryan Jean Briggs luwih condhong ing bab psikologi interpersonal lan sosialisasi bocah-bocah. Dhéwéké nyumbang akéh ing &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; psiko-analitis ing brebayan &lt;a href="Inuit"&gt;Inuit&lt;/a&gt; lan olèh pangaji saka &lt;a href="American%20Anthropological%20Association"&gt;American Anthropological Association&lt;/a&gt;. Uga dhèwèké olèh pangaji dhoktor kahormatan saka &lt;a href="Universitas%20Bergen"&gt;Universitas Bergen&lt;/a&gt; taun 1996.
