<doc id="146262" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=146262" title="Edward M. Bruner">
Edward M. Bruner

Edward M. Bruner ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt; City, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan 28 September 1924. Pendhidhikan sarjana saka Ohio State University (1948) uga ing pasca sarjanané (1950). Bruner olèh gelar Ph.D saka &lt;a href="University%20of%20Chicago"&gt;University of Chicago&lt;/a&gt; taun 1954. Panlitian lapangan kang dilakoni déning Bruner ya iku ing &lt;a href="New%20M%C3%A8ksiko"&gt;New Mèksiko&lt;/a&gt; (1948), Dahkota Utara (1952), Indian Amérika Chicago (1966), Batak Toba Sumatra (1967), &lt;a href="Jawa"&gt;Jawa&lt;/a&gt; (1969), &lt;a href="Bali"&gt;Bali&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="K%C3%A9nya"&gt;Kénya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mesir"&gt;Mesir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Isra%C3%A8l"&gt;Israèl&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ghana"&gt;Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, lan Yunnan China. Bruner wis nulis karya-karya antropologis kaya déné Text, Play and Story: The Construction and Reconstruction of Self and Society minangka editor (1984) lan The Anthropology of Experience minangka éditor (1986). Bruner wis kulina makarya lan nliti ing werna-werna bab topik. Nanging dhèwèké karenan ing bab post-modernisme, post-strukturalisme, lan panulisan ètnografis khususé cara nulis ceritané kang diceritaaké déning informan lan antropolog. Bruner iki minangka antropolog kang humanis lan wis nyumbang akéh marang korpus antropologi nganti limang dèkade.
