<doc id="146370" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=146370" title="Ralph Neville Hermon Bulmer">
Ralph Neville Hermon Bulmer

Ralph Neville Hermon Bulmer ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Hereford"&gt;Hereford&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Karajan%20Manunggal"&gt;Karajan Manunggal&lt;/a&gt;. Pandhidhikané Ralph Bulmer saka ing &lt;a href="Cambridge"&gt;Cambridge&lt;/a&gt; olèh gelar BA taun 1953 lan ing &lt;a href="Australian%20National%20University"&gt;Australian National University&lt;/a&gt; (Ph.D) taun 1960. Panlitian kang wis dilakoni déning Ralph Bulmer ya iku ing Sor-Vayanger, Lapland (1950), Papua Nugini (1954 lan 1960). Dhèwèké wis nulis karya-karya antropologis kaya déné ‘Why is the Cassowary not a bird? A problem of zoological taxonomy among the Karam of the New Guinea Highlands’ ing jurnal Man (1967) lan Birds of My Kalam Country (1977). Pakaryan ètnografiné Ralph Bulmer ing bebrayan Kalam ing Papua Nugini iku minangka tuladha standar panlitian kanggo &lt;a href="%C3%A8tnobiologi"&gt;ètnobiologi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="%C3%A8tnozoologi"&gt;ètnozoologi&lt;/a&gt;. Fokus panlitian dhèwèké iku ing bab antropolog Melanesia. Ralph Bulmer uga dadi profésor ing departemen antropologi &lt;a href="Univeristy%20of%20Papua%20New%20Guinea"&gt;Univerisity of Papua New Guinea&lt;/a&gt; (1968-1974) lan profésor sosial antropologi ing &lt;a href="University%20of%20Auckland"&gt;University of Auckland&lt;/a&gt; (1974-1988).
