<doc id="146371" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=146371" title="Ruth Leah Bunzel">
Ruth Leah Bunzel

Ruth Leah Bunzel ya iku ahli &lt;a href="Antropologi%20sastra"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; wanita saka &lt;a href="New%20York%20City"&gt;New York City&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan 18 April 1898. Pandhidhikan Ruth saka ing &lt;a href="Barnard%20College"&gt;Barnard College&lt;/a&gt; (BA) taun 1918. Sabanjuré dhèwèké olèh gelar Ph.D ing &lt;a href="Columbia%20University"&gt;Columbia University&lt;/a&gt; taun 1929. Panlitian lapangan Ruth kang wis dilakoni ya iku ing Zuni (1924), &lt;a href="M%C3%A8ksiko"&gt;Mèksiko&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Guatemala"&gt;Guatemala&lt;/a&gt; (1930), lan &lt;a href="Spanyol"&gt;Spanyol&lt;/a&gt; (1930). Karya-karyané Ruth saka panlitiané iku antarané The Pueblo Potter: A Study of Creative Imagination in Primitive Art (1929), Zuni Texts (1933), ‘The role of alcoholism in two Central American cultures’, ing jurnal Psychiatry (1940), lan Chichicastenango, a Guatemalan Village (1952). Bunzel iki minangka anak bimbingané Franz Boas lan miwiti panlitian pertamané ing bebrayan Indian Pueblo. Dhèwèké dadi pelopor ing bab nggabungké kajian seni (kagunan) karo psikologi individual.
