Marina Butovskaya ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; wanita saka Cherkassy, &lt;a href="Ukraina"&gt;Ukraina&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan 27 Juni 1959. Pandhidhikané Marina saka ing &lt;a href="Moscow%20State%20University"&gt;Moscow State University&lt;/a&gt; (MA) taun 1982, &lt;a href="Soviet%20Academy%20of%20Sciences"&gt;Soviet Academy of Sciences&lt;/a&gt; (Ph.D) taun 1986. Lan sabanjuré ing &lt;a href="Russian%20Academy%20of%20Sciences"&gt;Russian Academy of Sciences&lt;/a&gt; (D.Sc) taun 1994. Panlitian antropologis Marina ya iku ing Abkhazia (1980), Moskow (1993 lan 1998), padesaan Ruslan tengah (1995), lan Kalmykia (1996). Karya-karyané kang wis diterbitké ya iku antarané On the Origin of Human Society (1993) lan Variabilité des relations sociales chez les primates humains et non humains: à la recherche d’un paradigme general’,(&lt;a href="basa%20Inggris"&gt;basa Inggris&lt;/a&gt;: ‘Variability of social relations among human and non human primates: towards research of a general paradigm’) kang dikemot ing jurnal Primatologie. Sawiji pisumbangané ya iku dhèwèké nggabungké cara &lt;a href="%C3%A8tnografi"&gt;ètnografi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Antropologi"&gt;antropologi budaya&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="sosiologi"&gt;sosiologi&lt;/a&gt; kanggo sinau dumunung fénoména pola prilaku manungsa ing &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt; modhèrn.
