<doc id="146373" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=146373" title="Lionel Caplan">
Lionel Caplan

Lionel Caplan ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka Montreal, Quebec, &lt;a href="Kanada"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt; kalairan 16 Novèmber 1931. Caplan olèh pandhidhikan pawiyatan luhur saka ing &lt;a href="McGill%20University"&gt;McGill University&lt;/a&gt; (B.Comm.) taun 1954 lan olèh gelar MA lan Ph.D. saka School of Oriental and African Studies, &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt; taun 1963 lan 1966. Panlitian kang wis dilakoni Caplan ya iku ing padésan &lt;a href="N%C3%A9pal"&gt;Népal&lt;/a&gt; wétan (1964), Dailekh Nepal wétan (1969), lan kutha Madras ing &lt;a href="Indhi"&gt;Indhi&lt;/a&gt; kidul (1974, 1981, 1991, 1996, 1999). Karya-karya kang wis tinulis déning Caplan ya iku antarané Land and Social Change in East Nepal: A Study of Hindu-Tribal Relations (1970), Class and Culture in Urban India: Fundamentalism in a Christian community (1987), lan Children of Colonialism: Anglo-Indians in a Postcolonial World (2001). Kajian antropologiné Caplan ya iku ing agama &lt;a href="Kristen"&gt;Kristen&lt;/a&gt; ing Madras lan dadi isu poskolonial lan hibriditas budaya. Amarga iku, dadi sawiji pisumbangané ing bab Anglo-India.
