<doc id="146393" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=146393" title="James G. Carrier">
James G. Carrier

James G. Carrier ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Washington%2C%20D.C."&gt;Washington DC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan taun 1947. Pandhidhikan ing pawiyatan luhur naté ana ing &lt;a href="University%20of%20Virginia"&gt;University of Virginia&lt;/a&gt; taun 1972 (BA) lan 1973 (MA). Uga ing London School of Economics taun 1977 (Ph.D.). Panlitian antropologis kang dilakoni James ya iku ing Pulo Ponam, &lt;a href="Papua%20Nugini"&gt;Papua Nugini&lt;/a&gt; (1978 nganti 1986) lan &lt;a href="Jamaika"&gt;Jamaika&lt;/a&gt; (1997). Karya-karya kang wis ditulis déning James iku antarané History and Tradition in Melanesian Anthropology (1992), Gifts and Commodities: Exchange and Western Capitalism since 1700 (1995), Occidentalism: Images of the West (1995), lan Meanings of the Market: The Free Market in Western Culture (1997). Pisumbangan James sawijiné iku nggawa owah-owahan ing antropologi &lt;a href="M%C3%A8lan%C3%A9sia"&gt;Mélanésia&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèweké nuduhaké bebrayan &lt;a href="M%C3%A8lan%C3%A9sia"&gt;Mélanésia&lt;/a&gt; iku dipandhang minangka hal kang kontemporer lan ana owahané.
