<doc id="146397" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=146397" title="Margaret Clark">
Margaret Clark

Margaret Clark ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; wanita saka &lt;a href="Texas"&gt;Texas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan 9 Januari 1925. Margaret naté olèh pandhidhikan saka &lt;a href="Southern%20Methodist%20University"&gt;Southern Methodist University&lt;/a&gt; taun 1945 lan &lt;a href="University%20of%20California"&gt;University of California&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Berkeley"&gt;Berkeley&lt;/a&gt; taun 1957 (Ph.D). Margaret uga naté nglakoni panlitian lapangan ana ing San Jose, &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt; (1954), padésan &lt;a href="Colorado"&gt;Colorado&lt;/a&gt; (1957), &lt;a href="Arizona"&gt;Arizona&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="San%20Francisco"&gt;San Francisco&lt;/a&gt; (1960). Karya-karya antropologis kang wis ditulis déning dhèwèké ya iku kaya déné Health in the Mexican-American Culture: A Community Study (1959) lan Culture and Aging: An Anthropological Study of Older Americans (1967). Awité, Margaret didhidhik minangka dhokter lan lumebu ing sekolah kedhokteran. Sawisé gegladhén kedhokteran ing bebrayan, Margaret Clark karenan ing &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt;. Sabanjuré dhèwèké ketemu karo Margaret Mead lan ana parembugan karo Mead. Sawisé iku, Margaret Clark karenan dadi antropolog budaya. Sawiji pisumbangan dhèwèké ya iku ngadegaké Multidisciplinary Training Program in Applied Gerontology ana ing &lt;a href="San%20Francisco"&gt;San Francisco&lt;/a&gt;.
