<h2>Rujukan</h2>

</doc>
<doc id="146783" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=146783" title="Frederica de Laguna">
Frederica de Laguna

Frederica de Laguna ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; wanita saka Ann Arbor, Michigan, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan 03 Oktober 1906. Frederica naté kuliah sarjana ing Bryn Mawr College taun 1927. Sabanjuré ana ing Columbia University (Ph.D.) taun 1933. Dhéwéké nglakoni panlitian ing &lt;a href="Grunlan"&gt;Grunlan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Alaska"&gt;Alaska&lt;/a&gt; (1930 nganti 1994) lan uga ing Pima (1936). Karya-karya kang tinulis déning Frederica ya iku antarané The Story of a Tlingit Village: A Problem in the Relationship between Archaeological, Ethnological and Historical Methods (1960), Under Mount Saint Elias: The History and Culture of the Yakutat Tlingit (1972), Voyage to Grunlan: A Personal Initiation into Anthropology (1977), lan The Tlingit Indians minangka èditor taun 1991. Frederica dadi salah siji antropolog Amérika kang fokus ing bab arkéologi. Dhéwéké uga dadi salah siji siswi bimbingané &lt;a href="Franz%20Boas"&gt;Franz Boas&lt;/a&gt;.
