<doc id="146812" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=146812" title="Cora Du Bois">
Cora Du Bois

Cora Du Bois ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; wanita kalairan &lt;a href="Brooklyn"&gt;Brooklyn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan taun 1903. Du Bois naté olèh pandhidhikan ana ing Barnard College (BA) taun 1927. Sabanjuré MA ing Columbia University (1928) lan Ph.D. ing University of California, Berkeley (1932). Panlitian antropologis naté ing &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Oregon"&gt;Oregon&lt;/a&gt; (1929), Alor &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; (1938), &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indhi"&gt;Indhi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sri%20Lanka"&gt;Sri Lanka&lt;/a&gt; (1942-1954), lan Orissa Indhi (1961). Du Bois uga nulis werna-werna karya akademis, kaya déné Wintu Ethnography (1935), ‘Some anthropological perspectives on psycho-analysis’ ana ing jurnal Psycho-Analytic Review (1937), The People of Alor (1944), Social Forces in Southeast Asia (1949). Nalika ing Alor, dhèwèké nganggo metode tés &lt;a href="psikologi"&gt;psikologi&lt;/a&gt; lan ngumpulaké crita urip ing pakaryan &lt;a href="%C3%A8tnografi"&gt;ètnografi&lt;/a&gt;. Karyané The People of Alor dadi landmark ing bab kajian antropologi psikologi.
