<doc id="147800" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=147800" title="Robert Edgerton">
Robert Edgerton

Robert Edgerton ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; lan (uga &lt;a href="sosiologi"&gt;sosiologi&lt;/a&gt;) saka Maywood, Illinois, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;t, kalairan 28 November 1931. Robert naté olèh pandhidhikan ing pawiyatan luhur ana ing University of California, &lt;a href="Los%20Angeles"&gt;Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt; (BA) taun 1956. Dhèwèké uga lan olèh gelar Ph.D. saka ing pawiyatan kang padha taun 1960. Robert duwé pangalaman panlitian antropologis ana ing Wisconsin &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; (1956), Afrika wétan (&lt;a href="Uganda"&gt;Uganda&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kenya"&gt;Kenya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tanzania"&gt;Tanzania&lt;/a&gt; taun 1961), &lt;a href="Hawaii"&gt;Hawaii&lt;/a&gt; (1970), Kenya (1987), lan &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt; (1960). Karya-karya akademis kang tinulis déning Robert ya iku antarané The Individual in Cultural Adaptation: A Study of Four East African Societies (1971), Mental Retardation (1979), The Cloak of Competence (1993), lan Sick Societies: Challenging the Myth of Primitive Harmony (1992). Pisumbangan utama saka Robert ya iku bab kajian analisis mèntal lan antropologi psikologi ana ing bebrayan Afrika wétan. Robert uga kawentar minangka sarjana kang inovatif ing bab kuwi.
