<doc id="147802" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=147802" title="Frederick Russell Eggan">
Frederick Russell Eggan

Frederick Russell Eggan ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka Seattle, &lt;a href="Washington"&gt;Washington&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan 12 Septèmber 1906. Frederick Eggan olèh pandhidhikan pawiyatan luhur saka ing University of Chicago. Saka pawiyatan iku, dhèwèké olèh gelar BA taun 1928, MA taun 1929, lan Ph.D. taun 1933. Frederick uga naté nglakoni panlitian lapangan antarané ana ing Hopi, Pueblos kulon (1932), Choctaw Arapaho (1933), lan &lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Filipina&lt;/a&gt; (1934). Karya-karya akademis kang tinulis déning Frederick ya iku The Social Organization of North American Tribes minangka èditor (1937), Social Organization of the Western Pueblos (1950), ‘Social anthropology and the method of controlled comparison’ ana ing jurnal American Anthropologist (1954), The American Indian: Perspectives for the Study of Social Change (1966), lan Essays in SocialAnthropology and Ethnology (1975). Dhéwéké duwé uga dhasar ngèlmu arkéologi ing bebrayan Indian. Frederick ana kapinteran ya iku bisa nganggo metodé perspéktif antropologi Britania lan tradisi Amérika ing pakaryané.
