<doc id="147877" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=147877" title="Veit Erlmann">
Veit Erlmann

Veit Erlmann ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; lan ètnomusikolog saka Essen, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan taun 1951. Riwayat pandhidhikané Veit nalika ing pawiyatan luhur ya iku ana ing Free University ing Berlin (gelar MA taun 1974), University of Cologne (gelar Ph.D. taun 1978 lan Dr.habil taun 1990). Sabanjuré, nampa gelar Dr.habil. saka ing Free University ing Berlin taun 1994. Veit wis nglakoni panlitian antropologis ing werna-werna panggonan, ya iku antarané &lt;a href="Kamerun"&gt;Kamerun&lt;/a&gt; (1975, 1995), &lt;a href="Niger"&gt;Niger&lt;/a&gt; (1979), &lt;a href="Lesotho"&gt;Lesotho&lt;/a&gt; (1982), &lt;a href="Afrika%20Kidul"&gt;Afrika Kidul&lt;/a&gt; (1981-1986), &lt;a href="Ghana"&gt;Ghana&lt;/a&gt; (1988), lan &lt;a href="Ekuador"&gt;Ekuador&lt;/a&gt; (1989). Karya-karya akademis kang tinulis déning Veit ya iku African Stars: Studies in Black African Performance (1991), Nightsong: Performance, Power, and Practice in South Africa (1995), ‘The aesthetics of the global imagination: reflections on world music in the1990s’ kang ana ing jurnal Public Culture (1996), lan Music, Modernity, and the Global Imagination: South Africa and the West (1999). Ing akhir taun 1990, dhèwèké naté ana panlitian ing Indonesia, khususé &lt;a href="Jawa"&gt;Jawa&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sumatra"&gt;Sumatra&lt;/a&gt; bab sujarah musik. Dhèwèké uga naté nampa pangaji Alan P. Merriam minangka pamenang ing bab ètnomusikologi.
