Zoë Wanamaker iku wis akèh kerjasama karo &lt;a href="Royal%20Shakespeare%20Company"&gt;Royal Shakespeare Company&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="National%20Theatre"&gt;National Theatre&lt;/a&gt; ing Britania Agung. Dhèwèké wis taun olèh nominasi ping sanga kanggo pangaji Olivier Award, lan menangaké kanggo &lt;a href="Once%20in%20a%20Lifetime"&gt;Once in a Lifetime&lt;/a&gt; (1979) lan &lt;a href="Electra"&gt;Electra&lt;/a&gt; (1998). Awaké uga olèh patang nominasi pangaji Tony Award kanggo karyané ing Broadway; kanggo &lt;a href="Piaf"&gt;Piaf&lt;/a&gt; (1981), &lt;a href="Loot"&gt;Loot&lt;/a&gt; (1986), &lt;a href="Electra"&gt;Electra&lt;/a&gt; (1999), lan &lt;a href="Awake%20and%20Sing%21"&gt;Awake and Sing!&lt;/a&gt; (2006).
Ing kelir amba Zoé Wanamaker mèlu main ing &lt;a href="Wilde"&gt;Wilde&lt;/a&gt; (1997), &lt;a href="Harry%20Potter%20and%20the%20Philosopher%27s%20Stone"&gt;Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone&lt;/a&gt; (2001), lan &lt;a href="My%20Week%20with%20Marilyn"&gt;My Week with Marilyn&lt;/a&gt; (2011), kamangka paragané ing kelir cilik télévisi iku kalebu minangka Tessa Piggott ing sérial drama &lt;a href="Love%20Hurts"&gt;Love Hurts&lt;/a&gt; (1992–1994) lan minangka Susan Harper ing komedi situasi &lt;a href="My%20Family"&gt;My Family&lt;/a&gt; (2000–2011). Awaké uga mèlu main ing drama ITV &lt;a href="Agatha%20Christie%27s%20Poirot"&gt;Agatha Christie's Poirot&lt;/a&gt;, maragakaké &lt;a href="Ariadne%20Oliver"&gt;Ariadne Oliver&lt;/a&gt; (2005–2013) lan Mr Selfridge (2015).

