<doc id="147989" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=147989" title="Harvey A. Feit">
Harvey A. Feit

Harvey A. Feit ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka ing Bronx, &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan taun 1941. Awité Harvey kuliah ing pawiyatan luhur Queen’s University (BA Hons) taun 1967, McGill University (MA) taun 1969, lan McGill University (Ph.D.) taun 1979. Panlitian lapangan antropologis kang dilakoni déning Harvey ya iku ana ing Waswanipi, &lt;a href="Quebec"&gt;Quebec&lt;/a&gt; (1968, 1978, 1997-2000), Quebec, Montréal, Ottawa (1974), Geneva, &lt;a href="Paris"&gt;Paris&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Toronto"&gt;Toronto&lt;/a&gt; (1984). Karya-karya akademis dhèwèké kang wis tinerbit ya iku antarané ‘Self-management and state-management: forms of knowing and managing northern wildlife’, M.R.M.Freeman lan L.N.Carbyn (eds) ana ing buku Traditional Knowledge and Renewable Resource Management in Northern Regions (1988), ‘James Bay Cree self-governance and land management’ ana ing buku We Are Here: Politics of Aboriginal Land Tenure (1989). Salah siji pisumbangané ya iku panlitiané sing nggabungké investigasi ètnografi bab ètnoèkologi lan hubungané karo pulitik administratif wong aborigin lan pamréntah ing Québec.
