<doc id="148030" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=148030" title="Joshua A. Fishman">
Joshua A. Fishman

Joshua A. Fishman (שיקל פישמאן Shikl Fishman) (&lt;a href="18%20Juli"&gt;18 Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1926"&gt;1926&lt;/a&gt; – &lt;a href="1%20Maret"&gt;1 Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2015"&gt;2015&lt;/a&gt;) ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="sosiologi"&gt;sosiologi&lt;/a&gt; saka Philadeplhia, Penssylvania, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;.. Pandhidhikané olèh saka University of Pennsylvania (olèh gelar BS lan MS) taun 1948. Sabanjuré ing Colombia University (Ph.D.) taun 1953. Karya-karya kang tinulis déning dhèwèké lan tinerbit ya iku antarané Readings in the Sociology of Language, minangka éditor (1968), Yiddish: Turning to Life (1991), lan Handbook of Language and Ethnic Identity (1999). Joshua wis naté nglakoni panlitian lapangan ing werna-werna wewengkon. Joshua uga dadi pangadeg sosiologi basa, paradigma panlitiané nerapaké metode kajian basa lan bebrayan. Dhèwèké uga dadi salah siji tokoh kang ngadegaké sub-disiplin antropologi basa, bareng karo Dell Hymes lan John Gumperz.
