<doc id="148038" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=148038" title="James J. Fox">
James J. Fox

James J. Fox ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka ing Milwaukee, Wisconsin, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan 29 Mèi 1940. James naté olèh pandhidhikan pawiyatan luhur Harvard University (AB) taun 1962. Sabanjuré ana ing University of Oxford (B.Litt) taun 1965 lan D.Phil ing taun 1968. Panlitian antropologis kang dilakoni déning James ana ing Timor (1981, 1998 nganti 2002) lan Pulo Rote (1965, 1973). Uga naté ing &lt;a href="Jawa%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Jawa Wetan&lt;/a&gt; (1981), &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt; (1975). Karya-karya kang tinulis déning dhèwèké ya iku antarané Harvest of the Palm: Ecological Change in Eastern Indonesia (1977), To Speak in Pairs: Essays on the Ritual Languages of Eastern Indonesia (1988), Origins, Ancestry and Alliance: Explorations in Austronesian Ethnography (1996), lan Out of the Ashes: Destruction and Reconstruction of East Timor (2000). James iki minangka salah siji antropolog kang akéh pisumbangané ing bab &lt;a href="%C3%A8tnografi"&gt;ètnografi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;.
