<doc id="148039" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=148039" title="Richard Gabriel Fox">
Richard Gabriel Fox

Richard Gabriel Fox ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan tanggal 2 Maret 1939. Richard naté kuliah ing Columbia University (AB) taun 1960. Sabanjuré ana ing University of Michigan (MA) taun 1961 lan Ph.D. taun 1965. Dhèwèké uga naté nglakoni panlitian lapangan antropologis ana inf Uttar Pradesh &lt;a href="Indhi"&gt;Indhi&lt;/a&gt; (1963), Edinburgh (1975), lan Delhi, Punjab, Indhi (1980, 1981). Saka panlitiané, Richard nulis karya-karya akademis kaya déné From Zamindar to Ballot Box: Community Change in a North Indian Market Town (1969), Kin, Clan, Raja, and Rule: State-Hinterland Relations in Pre-Industrial India (1971), Lions of the Pinjab: Culture in the Making (1985), lan Gandhian Utopia: Experiments with Culture (1989). Richard nyumbangké panemuné ing bab analisis bebrayan sing komplèks kaya ing Indhi. Karyané sing kaping kapisan ya iku nuduhaké kajian kutha pasar cilik &lt;a href="Indhi"&gt;Indhi&lt;/a&gt;.
