<doc id="148124" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=148124" title="Clifford Geertz">
Clifford Geertz

Clifford Geertz ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="San%20Francisco"&gt;San Francisco&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan taun 1926. Geertz olèh pandhidhikan pawiyatan luhur ana ing Antioch College (BA) taun 1950 lan Harvard University (Ph.D.) taun 1950. Panlitian antropologis Geertz naté ana ing Paré, &lt;a href="Jawa"&gt;Jawa&lt;/a&gt; (taun 1952, 1971, lan 1986). Sabanjuré ing &lt;a href="Bali"&gt;Bali&lt;/a&gt; taun 1957-1958 lan Sefrou, &lt;a href="Maroko"&gt;Maroko&lt;/a&gt; (taun 1963, 1968, 1969, 1972, lan 1976). Karya-karya antropologis kang sinerat déning dhèwèké ya iku antarané Peddlers and Princes: Social Change and Economic Modernization in Two Indonesian Towns (1963), The Interpretation of Cultures (1973), Local Knowledge: Further Essays in Interpretive Anthropology (1983), lan Works and Lives: The Anthropologist as Author (1988). Geertz iki duwé revolusi intertretasi ing lintas disiplin. Geerts karenan ing bab struktural lan ndadiaké antropologi sosiobudhaya iku prestise ing antara èlmu filosofi, kritik sastra, sujarah lan pulitik.
