<doc id="148150" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=148150" title="Peter Geschiere">
Peter Geschiere

Peter Geschiere ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Belanda"&gt;Belanda&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan taun 1941. Peter olèh pandhidhikan pawiyatan luhur ana ing Free University, MA sujarah taun 1967, MA antropologi ing taun 1969, lan Ph.D. antropologi ing taun 1978. Panlitian lapangan antropologisé Peter ana ing &lt;a href="Tunisia"&gt;Tunisia&lt;/a&gt; taun 1969, &lt;a href="Kamerun"&gt;Kamerun&lt;/a&gt; (bebrayan abasa Prancis) taun 1971, 1973, 1980. Uga ing &lt;a href="Senegal"&gt;Senegal&lt;/a&gt; kidul taun 1987 lan Kamerun (bebrayan abasa Inggris) taun 1987. Karya-karya akademis kang tinulis déning Peter ya iku antarané Village Communities and the State: Changing Relations in Maka Villages of Southeast Cameroon (1982), Old Modes of Production and Capitalist Encroachment. Anthro-pological Explorations in Africa (1985), lan The Modernity of Witchcraft. Politics and the Occult in Postcolonial Africa (1997). Fokus pakaryan panlitian Peter iki ana ing bab nguji dinamika budhaya ing interaksi kolonial lan paska kolonial ana ing &lt;a href="Afrika"&gt;Afrika&lt;/a&gt; kulon.
