<doc id="148151" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=148151" title="Michael Gilsenan">
Michael Gilsenan

Michael Gilsenan ya iku ahli antropologi saka London, Karajan Manunggalm kalairan tanggal 6 Februari 1940. Pandhidhikan pawiyatan luhur kang dijupuk Michael ya iku ana ing Unversity of Oxford (BA) taun 1963, Diploma Anthropology taun 1964, lan D.Phil. taun 1967. Panlitian antropologis kang linakonan ya iku ana ing &lt;a href="Mesir"&gt;Mesir&lt;/a&gt; taun 1964 nganti 1966, &lt;a href="Lebanon"&gt;Lebanon&lt;/a&gt; taun 1971 nganti 1972, lan bab proyek diaspora &lt;a href="Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt; ing werna-weran wewengkon Eropa lan Asia Tenggara taun 1999 nganti 2000, 2001-2002. Karya-karya akademis kang tinulis ya iku antarané Saint and Sufi in Modern Egypt: An Essay in the Sociology of Religion (1973), ‘Lying, honor and contradiction’ ana ing buku Transaction and Meaning: Directions in the Anthropology of Exchange and Symbolic Behavior (1976), Recognizing Islam: An Anthropologist’s Introduction (1982), Lords of the Lebanese Marches: Violence and Narrative in a Lebanese Society (1996). Michael iki akéh kang nuduhaké bab sufi ing dunya Islam, mligi ing Mesir lan praktik sosial.
