<doc id="148175" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=148175" title="Jane Carter Goodale">
Jane Carter Goodale

Jane Carter Goodale ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; wanita saka Boston, &lt;a href="Massachusetts"&gt;Massachusetts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan 18 Mei 1926. Jane olèh pandhidhikan pawiyatan luhur saka Radcliffe College (BA) taun 1948 lan MA taun 1951. Sabanjuré ana ing Ph.D. saka &lt;a href="University%20of%20Pennsylvania"&gt;University of Pennsylvania&lt;/a&gt; (Ph.D.) taun 1959. Panlitian lapangan antropologis kang linakonan Jane ya iku ana ing &lt;a href="Arizona"&gt;Arizona&lt;/a&gt; taun 1950, &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt; lor taun 1954, 1962, 1981, lan &lt;a href="Papua%20Nugini"&gt;Papua Nugini&lt;/a&gt; taun 1962, 1963, 1967, lan 1974. Karya-karya akademis kang sinerat déning Jane ya iku antarané Tiwi Wives: A Study of the Women of Melville Island, North Australia (taun 1971), The Tiwi of North Australia, sinerat bareng karo Hart lan Pilling taun 1988, To Sing with Pigs is Human: Concepts of Person in Papua New Guinea (taun 995), lan The Two-Party Line: Conversations in the Field (taun 1995). Jane iki kawentar amarga pisumbangané ing bab model panlitian &lt;a href="%C3%A8tnografi"&gt;ètnografi&lt;/a&gt; populer, organisasi sosial lan konsèp lintas budhaya humanis.
