<doc id="148241" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=148241" title="Richard Handler">
Richard Handler

Richard Handler ya iku ahli &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Indiana"&gt;Indiana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pennsylvania"&gt;Pennsylvania&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, kalairan ing tanggal 17 Mei 1950. Richard naté olèh pandhidhikan pawiyatan luhur ana ing &lt;a href="Columbia%20University"&gt;Columbia University&lt;/a&gt; (BA) ing taun 1972. Sabanjuré ing &lt;a href="University%20of%20Chicago"&gt;University of Chicago&lt;/a&gt; lan olih gelar MA ing taun 1976 lan Ph.D. ing taun 1979. Panlitian lapangan antropologis kang linakonan ya iku ana ing &lt;a href="Quebec"&gt;Quebec&lt;/a&gt; (taun 1976, 1977, 1980, 1983) lan ing Williamsburg, Virginia ing taun 1990. Karya-karya akademis kang sinerat déning Richard ya iku antarané Nationalism and the Politics of Culture in Quebec (1988), The Fiction of Culture: Jane Austen and the Narration of Social Realities (taun 1990), The New History in on Old Museum: Creating the Past at Colonial Williamsburg (1997), lan Excluded Ancestors, Inventible Traditions: Essays Toward a More Inclusive History of Anthropology, minangka èditor (taun 2000). Richard iki ana pisumbangané ing bab pulitik budaya ing nasionalis &lt;a href="Quebec"&gt;Quebec&lt;/a&gt;.
